T L DB Name                             F Leng  S D Remark
- - -- -------------------------------- - ----  - - ------------------------------
  1 AA KEY-FIELD                        A    12     U Unique descriptor
  1 AB ALPHA-FIELD                      A    64     N Alphanumeric
  1 AC NUMERIC-UNPACKED                 N     7.2   N Zoned decimal
  1 AD PACKED-FIELD                     P    13.3   N Packed decimal, sign nibble
  1 AE BINARY-FIELD                     B     4     N Binary, four bytes
  1 AF FLOATING-FIELD                   F     8     N Floating point
  1 AG LOGICAL-FIELD                    L     1     N Logical (TRUE/FALSE)
  1 AH UNICODE-FIELD                    U    40     N Unicode alphanumeric
  1 AI DATE-FIELD                       D     4     N Natural date
  1 AJ TIME-FIELD                       T     7     N Natural time
  1 AK LONG-ALPHA                       A  1024     N Long alphanumeric
  1 AL LOB-FIELD                        A     0     N Variable length (LOB)
M 1 AM MULTI-VALUE                      A    20     D Multiple-value, indexed
